{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/pulls/113347","id":3056095765,"node_id":"PR_kwDOAO6SJc62KFIV","html_url":"https://github.com/godotengine/godot/pull/113347","diff_url":"https://github.com/godotengine/godot/pull/113347.diff","patch_url":"https://github.com/godotengine/godot/pull/113347.patch","issue_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/113347","commits_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/pulls/113347/commits","review_comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/pulls/113347/comments","review_comment_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/pulls/comments{/number}","comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/113347/comments","statuses_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/statuses/3f42c0a4b4c5aec5eb9c46b7c25c31bfe9a74e82","number":113347,"state":"open","locked":false,"title":"Fix project path resetting when canceling folder browse in project manager","user":{"login":"LanzaSchneider","id":24624901,"node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjI0NjI0OTAx","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/24624901?v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/LanzaSchneider","html_url":"https://github.com/LanzaSchneider","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/LanzaSchneider/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/LanzaSchneider/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/LanzaSchneider/gists{/gist_id}","starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/LanzaSchneider/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/LanzaSchneider/subscriptions","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/LanzaSchneider/orgs","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/LanzaSchneider/repos","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/LanzaSchneider/events{/privacy}","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/LanzaSchneider/received_events","type":"User","user_view_type":"public","site_admin":false},"body":"### Issue\r\nWhen creating a new project, if the user:\r\n1. Opens the project creation dialog (default path A is shown)\r\n2. Clicks \"Browse\" and selects a different path B\r\n3. Clicks \"Browse\" again and presses \"Cancel\"\r\n\r\nhttps://github.com/user-attachments/assets/67659b4d-e989-489c-a989-a9ae295e8d66\r\n\r\nThe project path incorrectly reverts to the default path A instead of preserving the user-selected path B.\r\n\r\n### Root Cause\r\nIn `ProjectDialog::show_dialog()`, the path resetting logic is executed unconditionally after the folder browser closes, regardless of whether the user confirmed or canceled the selection.\r\n\r\n### Fix\r\nFor new project creation mode (`MODE_NEW`), skip the path resetting logic when the dialog is shown without confirmation (`p_is_confirmed=false`). This preserves the previously selected path when the user cancels the folder browser.\r\n\r\n### Testing\r\n- Reproduced the issue before the fix\r\n- Verified the path is now correctly preserved after canceling the browse dialog\r\n- Tested creating a project with the new behavior - works as expected\r\n\r\n**Note**: This is a minimal fix. A more comprehensive refactoring could separate the path initialization logic from the dialog display logic for better maintainability.\r\n","labels":[{"id":73330064,"node_id":"MDU6TGFiZWw3MzMzMDA2NA==","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/labels/bug","name":"bug","description":"","color":"ff6055","default":true,"archived_at":null,"archived_by":null},{"id":279098219,"node_id":"MDU6TGFiZWwyNzkwOTgyMTk=","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/labels/topic:editor","name":"topic:editor","description":"","color":"ffee88","default":false,"archived_at":null,"archived_by":null}],"milestone":{"id":8237783,"node_id":"MI_kwDOAO6SJc4AfbLX","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/milestones/16","html_url":"https://github.com/godotengine/godot/milestone/16","labels_url":"https://api.github.co